Comment: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:06.04,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Let's dance with me on a moonlit night
Comment: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Now I gotta go, as I want to
Comment: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.14,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,But I'll save the last dance for you
Comment: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:11.88,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Come on
Comment: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:29.58,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Doko e yukou ka yume kara sametara
Comment: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.70,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Safaia no yoru
Comment: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:37.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Namanurui kaze hisomete
Comment: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.64,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Makkura na hodo ni
Comment: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.02,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kirei na
Comment: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:47.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hitomi ga mabataku
Comment: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.42,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sotto dakiyosete
Comment: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yasashii
Comment: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:55.14,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kemono no koe de
Comment: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:57.14,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,You can do, we can do, try
Comment: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Oasobi no mama
Comment: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.24,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ijirashii mama
Comment: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.16,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kimi rashiku abarete
Comment: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.28,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Fuzakenai nante
Comment: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:14.40,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumaranai bokura rashiku odorasete
Comment: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:20.66,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,I'll save the last dance for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:06.04,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Venha dançar comigo ao luar hoje à noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.78,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Agora tenho que ir...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.14,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Mas vou deixar a última dança para você.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:11.88,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:29.58,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Para onde devemos ir quando acordamos desse sonho?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.70,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Na noite de safira...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:37.78,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}um vento quente sopra silenciosamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.64,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Quanto mais escuro é,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.02,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}mais brilhantes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:47.00,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}seus olhos ficam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.42,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Segure-me gentilmente...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.82,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}e fale comigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:55.14,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Com uma voz suave e feroz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:57.14,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Você pode fazer isso, nós podemos fazer isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.48,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Continue dançando comigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.24,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}mesmo que seja um desastre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.16,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}E seja tão violento.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.28,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Não seja tonto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:14.40,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Vamos dançar sendo nós mesmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:20.66,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Vou deixar a última dança para você.
